<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In FrameEOL:Semantic Frame Induction using Causal Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Evaluation on Smaller Models</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In FrameEOL:Semantic Frame Induction using Causal Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Training Cost</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
